# ==========================================
# SWMS Monorepo Git Ignore
# ==========================================

# --- .NET Build & Visual Studio ---
**/bin/
**/obj/
.vs/
*.user
*.userosscache
*.suo
*.userprefs
*.sln.docstates
*.DotSettings.user
*.pidb
*.ide/
_ReSharper*/

# --- Node / Frontend ---
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/dist-ssr/
**/.vite/
**/.cache/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
.pnpm-store/

# --- Environment & Local Secrets ---
# Keep .env.example tracked; keep project configs that colleagues need
swstp/.env.local
swstp/.env.*.local
*.pem
*.key
*.crt

# --- Runtime Uploads & Test Evidence ---
# Keep structure and documentation, ignore uploaded payload image files
backend/**/evidence/sessionimages/*
!backend/**/evidence/sessionimages/.gitkeep
!backend/**/evidence/README.md

# --- Workspace & Scratch Files ---
Solid Waste/
bin/
deploy/
MotionDetection/
PCB/
scratch_*.ps1
process_truck_assets.py
.svn/
**/.git_backup/

# --- OS & Editor Files ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
